<p>Kommt drauf an</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47736,"threadID":3613,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1464998368,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1465036164,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Eazy-E</strong></cite><p>Kommt drauf an<br></p></blockquote><p>Auf was? (wehe du sagst Profilbild, Zahlung muss eher im Voraus erfolgen <span class=\"missing-media\">[;)]</span> )</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47740,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465036258,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Also... eigentlich legen ja Grafiker den Preis fest. Just saying. :3 &#x27;Kommt drauf an&#x27; ist eher &#x27;ne schlechte Antwort.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47741,"threadID":3613,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1465036425,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dann schlag mir einen Preis vor<br>Und ich meine es kommt auf das Bild an</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47746,"threadID":3613,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1465053786,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Topic verschoben. Bitte nächstes mal drauf achten...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47747,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465056288,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Der Preis berechnet sich aus mehreren Faktoren.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- Hast du eine genauere Vorstellung als &quot;Süße Katze mit deinem Namen&quot;?<br>- Welche Farben sollten verwendet werden?<br>- Schriftart?<br>- Stil? (Cartoon, High-Quality, 8-Bit)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47753,"threadID":3613,"userID":2087,"username":"Flexutaki","subject":"","time":1465111305,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>ich fange dann mal an :^)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47768,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465131044,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1465131098,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich habe mich auch mal ein ein Logo/Profilbild gesetzt. Dafür habe ich zuerst eine Vorlage gezeichnet, diese eingescannt und in Illustrator nach gebildet.<br>Jetzt setze ich mich an die Farben und den Schriftzug.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47770,"threadID":3613,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1465131121,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1852-vinceg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@VinceG</a><br>Kostprobe pls? :^)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47781,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465142632,"lastEditTime":1465143486,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":1852,"editor":"VinceG","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1465144346,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1465149255,"value":1},{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1465325238,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ist zwar keine Glanzleistung, aber 100% individuell und ein absolutes Unikat.<br>Ich habe mich bei dem Katzenkopf zwar ein bisschen an ein Bild aus dem Internet orientiert, aber das ist trotzdem ein Unikat. Ich feile