":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":2165,"editor":"O.E.","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sieht richtig nice aus bis jetzt !<br>Und ja kannst du meinen Namen so rein schreiben?!  (EaZyE</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47795,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465151455,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich habe das LInework überarbeitet und EaZyE hin geschrieben... besser?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47796,"threadID":3613,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1465151565,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Jap , nur ich hätte gerne das Hintergrund beim Namen in Rot !</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47797,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465151993,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Mh. Orange Katze, roter Text Hintergrund. Aber ok. Wenn du was willst mache ich das.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47798,"threadID":3613,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1465156681,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Naja ich hab nicht gesagt das die Katze Orange sein muss , kann auch so wie in Tom und Jerry Grau Weiß sein , aber wenn es nicht umsetzbar ist will ichs lieber Orange</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47799,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465157917,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>In einem Profilbild oder Logo finde ich knalligere Farben besser. Deswegen habe ich Orange gewählt. <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47800,"threadID":3613,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1465159126,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1465159686,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1465159714,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1465163650,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1465375091,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>So. Finale Version. Auch, wenn an den Ränden von Fläche zu Outlines das ganze, warum auch immer, aufgehellt wurde.<br>Liegt eventuell an falschen Einstellungen in Illustrator oder an falscher Verarbeitung. Im Groben und Ganzen bin ich zufrieden mit dem Ergebnis. Ich hab mich übrigens dafür entschieden das Schild nicht mehr hinter die Katze zu setzen, weil so das ganze mehr nach einem Katzenfutter Logo aussieht und das finde ich witzig. xD. Von dem Überlegen was man machen kann, über die Skizze und dem Inken in Illustrator bis zum Finish habe ich ungefähr 2,5 Stunden an dem Bild gearbeitet.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47801,"threadID":3613,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1465163597,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sach mir nen Preis Vorschlag per PN<br>Und ach ja es  gefällt mir meeeggga !</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47805,"threadID":3613,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1465168705,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1465289377,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Sieht echt noice aus..</p>","polls":[]}]}